548	/// TurnTokenUsage had no reasoning_tokens field, so no adapter could ever price reasoning
549	/// tokens into total_cost_usd -- reasoning_output_tokens reached the final struct only via a
550	/// post-hoc field overwrite that never touched the pricing math. This test proves the DOLLAR
